~ start
set GlobalVariables.Instance.isTalking = true
if GlobalVariables.Instance.gaveAlingMarites == true:
    => gave_already
do GlobalVariables.Instance.OpenAnim()
Aling Marites: Pabili ako niyang balut, magkano?
- 15₱ po isa
	do GlobalVariables.Instance.GiveBalut(1)
	Aling Marites: Sige pabili ako isa lang.
	Aling Marites: Mag-ingat ka, gabi na at maraming kababalaghan sa barangay na 'to.
	do QuestSystem.Instance.TriggerQuestAdvance("aling_marites_has_balut")
	set GlobalVariables.Instance.gaveAlingMarites = true
	do GlobalVariables.Instance.CloseAnim()
	do GlobalVariables.Instance.alingMarites.OnDialogueEnded()
	set GlobalVariables.Instance.isTalking = false
	=> END

~ gave_already
Aling Marites: Sapat na ito iho.... Bukas nalang ulit ako bibili ha...
set GlobalVariables.Instance.isTalking = false
do GlobalVariables.Instance.alingMarites.OnDialogueEnded()
=> END


~ no_balut
Aling Marites: Anong ginagawa mo rito sa likod ng bahay ko?
- Naglalako po ng balut.
Aling Marites: Eh bat wala ka namang dala? Umalis ka na rito.
set GlobalVariables.Instance.isTalking = false
do GlobalVariables.Instance.alingMarites.OnDialogueEnded()
=> END

